# A scoped collection, a global closure, a global collection joined through
# the walk, and an enum literal.
rule fixture.blocked v0.1
says "A holder is BLOCKED if it is engaged with a firm that has an active listing itself, or is owned, directly or through a chain of owners, by a party that does."
subject holder
collection engagements : engagement for subject via holder
collection ownerships  : ownership
collection listings    : listing
closure owned-by over ownerships from owned to owner
conclude Blocked when
  some engagement e in engagements
  some listing l in listings
  require e.counterparty owned-by l.party
  require l.status = active
